      "id": "mat06q01",
      "en": "If + means × and × means −, evaluate 8 + 3 × 4 using the usual order of operations after replacement.",
      "as": "+ চিহ্নই × আৰু × চিহ্নই − বুজালে, চিহ্ন সলনি কৰাৰ পিছত সাধাৰণ ক্ৰিয়াক্ৰমে 8 + 3 × 4-ৰ মান উলিওৱা।",
      "options": [
        {
          "en": "28",
          "as": "28"
        },
        {
          "en": "8",
          "as": "8"
        },
        {
          "en": "32",
          "as": "32"
        },
        {
          "en": "20",
          "as": "20"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Replace the signs: 8 × 3 − 4 = 24 − 4 = 20.",
        "as": "চিহ্ন সলনি কৰিলে: 8 × 3 − 4 = 24 − 4 = 20।"
      }
